      "body": "## Summary\n\n```diff\ndoc/\n+ 2026-11-08_design_id6439_knowledge-interchange-and-export.md\n```\n\nDefines the Markdown interchange bundle and separate ID-native archive, target profiles for Obsidian/Logseq/Joplin, object mapping/loss manifest, read-authority closure rules, restore validation, and a reproducible target round-trip corpus. Preserves the five program questions as unresolved.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- **Before:** #6439 had no design deliverable.\n- **After:** the new design record covers the issue's format comparison, both export modes, mappings, privacy constraints, and objective round-trip oracles. Manual acceptance review against all three task criteria: pass.\n- `prettier --check doc/2026-11-08_design_id6439_knowledge-interchange-and-export.md` — pass.\n- `git diff --cached --check` — pass.\n- Live GUI round-trips were not run: Obsidian, Logseq, and Joplin are not installed here. The design records this explicitly and makes pinned-version corpus execution a pre-implementation gate.\n\n## Merge Danger\n\n**Door:** two-way — documentation-only proposal, reversible by reverting the file.\n\n**Blast Radius:** low\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796745379&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7747&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7747&signature=77af691a763ad99f9f5ec2620621b92cb21bfbc41fe56eed0d8075630d477ee2\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a